OL,3,GNEWSAFlood-hit Tesco wins approval for
OL,4,Araised car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA raised car park at a Tesco store in a
OL,7,FWest Sussex seaside town has been
OL,8,Fapproved despite objections from
OL,9,Fcouncil drainage specialists.
OL,11,FThe scheme to raise some spaces in the
OL,12,Fcar park of its supermarket on Shripney
OL,13,FRoad in Bognor Regis by 2m (6ft 6in),
OL,14,Fallowing customers to park there during
OL,15,Fperiods of flooding, has been approved
OL,16,Fby Arun District Council.
OL,18,FThe store was closed for nearly three
OL,19,Fweeks after flooding in 2023, when the
OL,20,Fcar park flooded following heavy rain.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
